      "message": "a) This doesn\u0027t handle --inject-scripts\u003ddeterministic.js,foo.js\nb) How about just changing --inject-archive-scripts behavior to prefer scripts stored in the archive in case of conflict (while still issuing a warning)? That way we don\u0027t need more special handling for deterministic.js",
