      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-04-13T11:36:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should we fix the help text then? Something along the lines of `By default deterministic.js is injected, unless a script with that name is already present in the archive`.",
      "parentUuid": "24ca6f10_0e5ff5e9",
      "revId": "42f327949bbf128f2a609a2b0780440cc25f8454",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
